* MINT-ERRORS: 27 10
* Ref: ../dbase3-decomp/specs/commands/set-commands.md:225
* PRINTER.OUT is the independent raw LPT stream: zero/five/zero margins.
? "[W2-BEGIN]"
? "[DEFAULT ZERO MARGIN]"
SET PRINT ON
? "X"
SET PRINT OFF
EJECT
SET MARGIN TO 5
? "[FIVE COLUMN MARGIN]"
SET PRINT ON
? "X"
SET PRINT OFF
EJECT
SET MARGIN TO 0
? "[MARGIN RESTORED TO ZERO]"
SET PRINT ON
? "X"
SET PRINT OFF
? "[NONNUMERIC MARGIN]"
SET MARGIN TO "BAD"
? "[MISSING TO]"
SET MARGIN 5
? "[W2-END]"
RETURN
